1
00:06:48,440 --> 00:06:50,560
- I don't know if you had it too?
- Yes we had.

2
00:06:50,640 --> 00:06:53,320
Before starting your first day.

3
00:06:53,400 --> 00:06:55,440
Then he said like this

4
00:06:55,520 --> 00:07:01,960
"The better trained you are the easier it will be mental"

5
00:07:02,040 --> 00:07:05,000
Because then you have time to think, then you are not as exhausted.

6
00:07:05,080 --> 00:07:06,400
So it is, absolutely!

7
00:07:06,400 --> 00:07:09,680
I remember one of the mental things like me -

8
00:07:09,760 --> 00:07:11,920
- In the beginning, during the undergraduate education anyway.

9
00:07:12,000 --> 00:07:14,160
It was special when we were out in the field.

10
00:07:28,520 --> 00:07:33,040
Just asking someone "How's it going?", "How are you?"
“Do you have clean socks?

11
00:07:33,120 --> 00:07:34,520
"Do you want a pair of socks?".

12
00:07:34,600 --> 00:07:37,720
Only something like that can make a huge difference to someone's well -being.

13
00:07:38,840 --> 00:07:40,240
Okay, then we'll see!

14
00:07:40,760 --> 00:07:43,840
Is it a lot of peer pressure and freezing?

15
00:07:44,720 --> 00:07:49,040
So, I would say that the commanders are really good at seeing through that.

16
00:07:49,120 --> 00:07:51,200
And what I have experienced is in that case

17
00:07:51,280 --> 00:07:52,520
That someone has flagged for it.

18
00:07:52,600 --> 00:07:56,280
And said well in advance, "now someone is really naughty here"

19
00:13:07,000 --> 00:13:09,040
- A small hospital.
- A little hospital yes!

20
00:13:09,120 --> 00:13:11,000
There you had to visit the doctor.

21
00:13:11,080 --> 00:13:15,200
I know I had sometimes -

22
00:13:15,280 --> 00:13:18,840
–Heelne inflammation from marching, and then they realized that

23
00:13:18,920 --> 00:13:20,920
"Okay, but then maybe you need to have soles"

24
00:13:21,000 --> 00:13:23,000
And then they put it in.
And it got much better ...

25
00:13:23,080 --> 00:13:24,440
... and solved the problem.

26
00:13:24,520 --> 00:13:28,120
So there are doctors to visit ...

27
00:13:28,200 --> 00:13:31,840
... and you get to flag them if it is something you feel bad about.
